    {
      "id": "s16",
      "start": 123.16,
      "end": 132.12,
      "narration": "You can click 'Explode' and it breaks apart every single layer of the watch into a 3D space. For an open source model, that level of spatial reasoning and 3D generation is completely unreal.",
      "intent": "layers",
